# Environment variables for the AI Content Production Engine.
#
# Phase 0 has no external integrations, so there is nothing to configure yet.
# This file exists now (per project convention) and will grow as later
# phases introduce real dependencies. Expected additions, by phase:
#
#   Phase 2 (LLM):        ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#   Phase 5 (Narration):  <TTS provider credential, provider TBD at Phase 5>
#   Phase 8 (YouTube):    <OAuth client id/secret, configured at Phase 8>
#
#   Phase 1 (Database):  ACE_DB_PATH=/path/to/content.db
#                         ACE_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG   (default: WARNING)

# Never put real secrets in this file. Copy it to a local .env file (which
# is git-ignored) and put actual values there instead.

# ACE_DB_PATH=
# ACE_LOG_LEVEL=WARNING
